# Security headers for the admin panel (Cloudflare Pages).
#
# This app authorises withdrawals, wallet adjustments and role changes, and it
# shipped with no CSP, no HSTS and no framing protection at all.
#
# Unlike the user web app, this project is a plain static SPA — no `_worker.js`,
# no Pages Functions — so every response IS a static asset response and these
# rules do apply to the HTML document. (The Expo app runs in advanced mode, where
# `_headers` does not reach documents, so its policy lives in public/_worker.js.)
#
# CSP notes:
#  - 'unsafe-inline' for style-src is required by the Tailwind/Radix runtime,
#    which injects style attributes. Scripts are NOT allowed inline.
#  - connect-src lists the API and Firebase endpoints the panel actually calls.
#    Anything else — including an injected exfiltration endpoint — is blocked.
#    It is exactly one API host: https://api.tophunt.in. No WebSocket entry,
#    because this app has no realtime subscription (the user app does), and no
#    media host, because it only ever *displays* media via <img>, which img-src
#    covers — deposit screenshots are never fetch()ed.
#  - https://*.workers.dev is deliberately GONE. On a page that can move money,
#    that wildcard made every Cloudflare customer's Worker a permitted
#    destination for stolen data. In local dev the Worker is reached through the
#    Vite proxy (same-origin, covered by 'self'), so nothing needs it.
#  - frame-ancestors 'none' prevents clickjacking of the admin UI.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.tophunt.in https://*.googleapis.com https://*.firebaseio.com wss://*.firebaseio.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'

# Immutable, content-hashed build assets.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
